# 0003 — VAAPI import of the alpha 10-bit RGB DRM formats.
#
# Not gateable, and this file is the declaration of that rather than an absence someone has to
# notice. The patch adds two entries to vaapi_drm_format_map in libavutil/hwcontext_vaapi.c; a
# format-table entry is not an AVOption and not a filter, so it appears in neither of the two
# things this gate can read. Proving it needs a real hwmap on AMD hardware, which a GPU-less
# runner does not have.
#
# Do not "fix" this by inventing a proxy check. A check that passes on a build without the patch
# is worse than no check: it converts an honest gap into a false claim of coverage.

ungateable  all  a vaapi_drm_format_map entry appears in neither -h encoder= nor -filters; proving it needs a real hwmap on AMD hardware, which a GPU-less runner does not have
